  {
    "location": "body/semantic/23",
    "kind": "h1",
    "text": "About TradeHQ",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-023",
    "contextText": "About TradeHQ",
    "sha256": "6f9dcf465718ac6f003426dce896299042e2a257a6fbc2da26aadb6159a9c0d0"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/24",
    "kind": "h2",
    "text": "Learning notes: About TradeHQ",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-024",
    "contextText": "Learning notes: About TradeHQ",
    "sha256": "480220cfcd9625ffe25f3307bf2d19d8c07c55a2752242784ab45e7b34d0abc1"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/25",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "TradeHQ is a free educational trading simulator built by Anuga Weerasinghe. It is not a brokerage and uses virtual money. Core simulator features work without signup; optional third-party services are described in the privacy policy. Ad serving is currently disabled.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-025",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ is a free educational trading simulator built by Anuga Weerasinghe. It is not a brokerage and uses virtual money. Core simulator features work without signup; optional third-party services are described in the privacy policy. Ad serving is currently disabled.",
    "sha256": "1a26f595fb3cacdb26588e13f7c29c2445e3225a995156df571608426bc4a557"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/26",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Published by TradeHQ, created by Anuga Weerasinghe. Publisher background and editorial approach. No independent professional review is claimed; any recorded source-check scope appears on the page.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-026",
    "contextText": "Published by TradeHQ, created by Anuga Weerasinghe. Publisher background and editorial approach. No independent professional review is claimed; any recorded source-check scope appears on the page.",
    "sha256": "1ecb0367a81cda8fd8c399ad684df90c1e8b5a4aeafa4707962690ae1b2b0318"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/27",
    "kind": "a",
    "text": "Publisher background and editorial approach",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-027",
    "contextText": "Publisher background and editorial approach",
    "sha256": "509bf6c9d15f52f6967569a6cc75bca66c9840a7203851469a7240a7d8f5621c"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/28",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Who builds TradeHQ",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-028",
    "contextText": "Who builds TradeHQ",
    "sha256": "c216ca2ac10703b99e7b5fecc0e0bea26a8d11ea2d04492bfadf9888063ee1c9"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/29",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "TradeHQ is maintained as an independent educational project to help learners explore market mechanics with virtual balances. The simulator does not require or enable real-money trading.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-029",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ is maintained as an independent educational project to help learners explore market mechanics with virtual balances. The simulator does not require or enable real-money trading.",
    "sha256": "b1e5bf3042485051c1e5453a0eea253395f6bf57dd6a658563ebca560e87b0b0"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/30",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "TradeHQ is an educational simulator, not a brokerage or registered investment adviser. It does not accept funds or place real securities orders, and no exchange or brokerage affiliation is claimed.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-030",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ is an educational simulator, not a brokerage or registered investment adviser. It does not accept funds or place real securities orders, and no exchange or brokerage affiliation is claimed.",
    "sha256": "6d915245064be07b59aafc44949bc7513a6012c5297f53704b9883d0c80aba0c"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/31",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "How the content is produced",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-031",
    "contextText": "How the content is produced",
    "sha256": "801cac2da9fcedc1d79624506b8058120fb07ec70d024953b1b4cbe6d171a9cd"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/32",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "TradeHQ uses AI-assisted drafting and editing for educational material and software. Content is prepared for this site rather than syndicated; AI assistance does not establish accuracy or originality by itself.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-032",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ uses AI-assisted drafting and editing for educational material and software. Content is prepared for this site rather than syndicated; AI assistance does not establish accuracy or originality by itself.",
    "sha256": "7d3aea5c2be470f1a74f855df0626ef2381a09fdc07a41f4b90f5410d2cbd359"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/33",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Factual claims about market mechanics cite exchange, regulator or central-bank documentation where possible.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-033",
    "contextText": "Factual claims about market mechanics cite exchange, regulator or central-bank documentation where possible.",
    "sha256": "4c4130ebdb9f056ec4023c1ce03f1cea22357defda1e45b5e9e7b19dbb7e1f2f"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/34",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Illustrative chart-pattern labels, calculated indicators and hypothetical scenarios should not be interpreted as verified price forecasts or personalised instrument recommendations.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-034",
    "contextText": "Illustrative chart-pattern labels, calculated indicators and hypothetical scenarios should not be interpreted as verified price forecasts or personalised instrument recommendations.",
    "sha256": "2004d10298398ee7ce69eca866369beea91a51c29958014166c51584ce54016a"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/35",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Errors are corrected when reported; the contact page is the fastest route.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-035",
    "contextText": "Errors are corrected when reported; the contact page is the fastest route.",
    "sha256": "a01b589e965efd8d3349311b46b8fcee6dfef2dc5d23c8f0d2a416c905281ad6"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/36",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "How the project is funded",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-036",
    "contextText": "How the project is funded",
    "sha256": "b4ae04f685a5f4737bff4f1b041e19c1af91f893a87732758e36103f84fce8e7"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/37",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "TradeHQ is free to use with no paid subscription or paid tier. The optional newsletter is also free. TradeHQ is not funded by broker referrals or by payment for asset coverage, and no company pays to appear in a lesson, comparison or guide.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-037",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ is free to use with no paid subscription or paid tier. The optional newsletter is also free. TradeHQ is not funded by broker referrals or by payment for asset coverage, and no company pays to appear in a lesson, comparison or guide.",
    "sha256": "a072615c0fdd3b732ca7347c5cad909fc6f25ed70ab27f4e16baa8ab1796ff5c"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/38",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Why this site exists",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-038",
    "contextText": "Why this site exists",
    "sha256": "109aa4eeb71ed54c7e29a84eb8ed2f0c45f9f87963784981a3052c7f1733ceaf"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/39",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "TradeHQ explains order mechanics, costs and the limits of simulation through worked examples and virtual practice.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-039",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ explains order mechanics, costs and the limits of simulation through worked examples and virtual practice.",
    "sha256": "c7aa3965abd14e60f372b2958bce66e04d404e953a42a6a1aabbe316e5cfa99d"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/40",
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "TradeHQ does not present practice results as evidence of future income. Community Reviews publish visitor-submitted feedback without independently verifying identity or experience. The Community Practice Board displays server-recorded ranked simulated portfolios, not verified investment returns.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-040",
    "contextText": "TradeHQ does not present practice results as evidence of future income. Community Reviews publish visitor-submitted feedback without independently verifying identity or experience. The Community Practice Board displays server-recorded ranked simulated portfolios, not verified investment returns.",
    "sha256": "9f03b3804a748b5a1257ccd22da837f850912a3f2b27708dbf54c10d1917470b"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/41",
    "kind": "h3",
    "text": "Editorial standards",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-041",
    "contextText": "Editorial standards",
    "sha256": "ad5fad9228634cbd5e8ea56612d0e83d5e65a0e9d83dfa218a8bc7abefecadb6"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/42",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Education-first positioning: illustrations of market indicators or price scenarios do not constitute verified trade signals, profitable strategies or personal financial recommendations.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-042",
    "contextText": "Education-first positioning: illustrations of market indicators or price scenarios do not constitute verified trade signals, profitable strategies or personal financial recommendations.",
    "sha256": "c2a43d905f480e828cb3206b27f37ca2eab8a9be9bc714b3dd349b527d4d690c"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/43",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "No invented statistics, testimonials, credentials or performance figures.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-043",
    "contextText": "No invented statistics, testimonials, credentials or performance figures.",
    "sha256": "a6b1ec3cb604a29091956bbdec5f184282ed5665f3ee8e8ccdce0534d1e6fd70"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/44",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Numbers in lessons are worked examples and are labelled as such.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-044",
    "contextText": "Numbers in lessons are worked examples and are labelled as such.",
    "sha256": "d8812ebec79f0b2ad46e853e0d0d3540e81f6516604159a76ee64d9f89d5a2bf"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/45",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Every page states that the platform is educational and simulated.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-045",
    "contextText": "Every page states that the platform is educational and simulated.",
    "sha256": "47a1b471dc28dff7f60e041a2673365955daf543c9098235be14151bf19b88f7"
  },
  {
    "location": "body/semantic/46",
    "kind": "li",
    "text": "Corrections are made promptly when a factual error is reported.",
    "id": "ABOUT-NOJS-046",
    "contextText": "Corrections are made promptly when a factual error is reported.",
    "sha256": "7e85f24668112235a19c5305c22916547f4d40df590213b3e9aaef3873b2f07f"
  },
  {
